WEBVTT

00:03.608 --> 00:04.641
Morning.

00:04.643 --> 00:05.575
Morning.

00:05.577 --> 00:08.178
Ooh, Cap'n Crunch.

00:08.180 --> 00:10.780
That's the only man
I put in my mouth.

00:10.782 --> 00:14.017
It puts my relationship
with Orville Redenbacher

00:14.019 --> 00:15.852
in a whole different light.

00:17.722 --> 00:20.240
I'm partial to the U.P.S. guy.

00:20.242 --> 00:22.943
We're making food jokes here.

00:22.945 --> 00:24.811
The U.P.S. guy's not food.

00:24.813 --> 00:27.197
He is if you cover him
with whipped cream.

00:29.100 --> 00:30.417
What can I say?

00:30.419 --> 00:33.787
There's just something
about a man in brown shorts.

00:33.789 --> 00:35.154
Okay, I'm in big trouble.

00:35.156 --> 00:37.874
Speaking of a man
with brown shorts.

00:39.043 --> 00:40.176
What's wrong?

00:40.178 --> 00:41.211
Well, I just got a call

00:41.213 --> 00:42.178
from Lyndsey's boyfriend Larry.

00:42.180 --> 00:43.162
And he wants to see me.

00:43.164 --> 00:44.798
Well, he wants
to see Jeff Strongman.

00:44.800 --> 00:46.549
Who's Jeff Strongman?

00:46.551 --> 00:48.334
Oh, Jeff Strongman

00:48.336 --> 00:50.470
is Alan's alter ego he uses

00:50.472 --> 00:52.889
to meet Larry and fight crime.

00:55.009 --> 00:58.011
Wait, so, you use a fake name
to sneak around with other men?

00:59.847 --> 01:02.449
Where do you guys meet?
A Lady Gaga concert?

01:02.451 --> 01:06.119
It was a spin class
if you must know.

01:06.121 --> 01:07.537
Now, what am I gonna do?

01:07.539 --> 01:09.406
I told you something
like this was gonna happen.

01:09.408 --> 01:12.292
(mocking): "I told you something like this
was gonna happen."

01:12.294 --> 01:14.911
Look, I am serious-- he wouldn't
tell me why he wanted to see me

01:14.913 --> 01:16.046
and he sounded pretty upset.

01:16.048 --> 01:17.831
Well, what kind of world
are we living in

01:17.833 --> 01:20.033
where a guy is upset
with another guy

01:20.035 --> 01:22.368
for banging his girlfriend?

01:23.304 --> 01:24.838
See, that's why
I love being gay.

01:24.840 --> 01:27.257
A guy finds out
I'm doing his girlfriend,

01:27.259 --> 01:28.725
I don't get an angry phone call.

01:28.727 --> 01:32.395
I get a dozen roses
and a copy of the video.

01:33.964 --> 01:36.599
Too bad I can't convince
Larry I'm gay.

01:36.601 --> 01:39.202
Come on, Zippy, you're making it
too easy for us.

01:44.992 --> 01:47.894
Oh, hey!

01:47.896 --> 01:48.895
There he is.

01:48.897 --> 01:51.064
My main man with a winter tan.

01:51.066 --> 01:52.949
Jeff.

01:52.951 --> 01:55.168
Uh, I got you a coffee.
Can I get you anything else?

01:55.170 --> 01:56.753
Uh, one-one of these muffins?
They're bran.

01:56.755 --> 01:58.071
Keeps your trains
running on time.

01:58.073 --> 01:59.839
Poop-poop!

01:59.841 --> 02:01.391
I'm not hungry.

02:01.393 --> 02:03.543
All right then, I'll just
sit across from you.

02:03.545 --> 02:05.378
Right here...

02:05.380 --> 02:07.630
in front
of all these witnesses.

02:07.632 --> 02:09.349
You know my girlfriend Lyndsey?

02:09.351 --> 02:10.383
Is it Lyndsey?

02:10.385 --> 02:11.634
I thought it was Linda.

02:11.636 --> 02:13.603
Glad you cleared that up
before I saw her again...

02:13.605 --> 02:15.805
which I haven't,
and why would I?

02:15.807 --> 02:16.940
She's been cheating on me.

02:16.942 --> 02:20.026
(hacking)

02:20.028 --> 02:21.694
Mmm, sorry.

02:21.696 --> 02:23.763
Just a little...
(clears throat)

02:23.765 --> 02:25.782
Why do you think
she's cheating on you?

02:25.784 --> 02:27.534
I hired a private investigator
to follow her.

02:27.536 --> 02:30.036
(hacking)

02:30.038 --> 02:32.906
Uh, do you mind?

02:32.908 --> 02:34.958
She's been meeting him
at a house in Malibu.

02:37.461 --> 02:39.746
Sorry, sorry,
I'm just a little shocked.

02:39.748 --> 02:41.280
Imagine how I feel.

02:41.282 --> 02:43.383
Well, I-I can't,
uh, uh, but I do know

02:43.385 --> 02:46.285
that in situations like this,
it's the woman who's to blame.

02:46.287 --> 02:48.838
She's not the only one.

02:48.840 --> 02:51.141
Please, I have a son!

02:51.143 --> 02:53.126
This is the guy.

02:54.428 --> 02:56.346
Wait, this is the guy?

02:56.348 --> 02:58.297
Yeah.

02:58.299 --> 03:00.183
This is guy you think
banging your girlfriend?

03:00.185 --> 03:01.184
I know he is.

03:01.186 --> 03:02.468
And only him?

03:02.470 --> 03:03.520
Nobody else?

03:03.522 --> 03:04.821
Isn't this bad enough?

03:04.823 --> 03:08.024
Well, sure.

03:08.026 --> 03:10.944
But, you know, there could
also be another explanation.

03:10.946 --> 03:12.612
I mean, maybe she's just lost

03:12.614 --> 03:14.197
and she's asking
this guy for directions.

03:14.199 --> 03:17.534
Right, "Excuse me, sir,
can you help me find my G-spot?"

03:18.419 --> 03:20.319
It's not just this photo.

03:20.321 --> 03:22.038
It's the late night errands.

03:22.040 --> 03:23.339
Hiding her phone.

03:23.341 --> 03:24.958
Plus, we haven't had sex
in forever!

03:24.960 --> 03:26.659
Wow, that's rough.

03:26.661 --> 03:29.328
I guess this guy, whoever he is,

03:29.330 --> 03:32.849
satisfies her every need.

03:32.851 --> 03:34.100
I want to kill him.

03:34.102 --> 03:36.002
I hate being
lied to like this.

03:36.004 --> 03:37.336
I get it, you know.

03:37.338 --> 03:40.273
Sometimes you think you know
a person, but you don't.

03:40.275 --> 03:42.275
Panini for Strongman.

03:45.146 --> 03:46.396
Jeff, that's you.

03:46.398 --> 03:47.564
What?

03:47.566 --> 03:49.265
Oh, oh, yeah, that's me.

03:50.734 --> 03:52.502
Jeff Strongman.

03:52.504 --> 03:55.121
Someone who's not banging
anyone's girlfriend.

03:55.123 --> 03:57.957
♪ Men, men, men, men, manly men,
men, men ♪

03:57.959 --> 04:01.010
♪ Ah.
♪ Men.

04:01.035 --> 04:05.035
&lt;font color="#00FF00">♪ Two and a Half Men 11x08 ♪&lt;/font>
&lt;font color="#00FFFF">Mr. Walden, He Die. I Clean Room.&lt;/font>
