04:18.005 --> 04:21.340
Oh, no, there's a stranger
in my house.

04:21.342 --> 04:24.577
And it's possibly
a gay porn star from the '70s.

04:24.579 --> 04:27.046
It's me, Alan.

04:27.048 --> 04:28.664
I-I believe you're
supposed to say,

04:28.666 --> 04:30.833
(Italian accent):
"It's-a me, a-Mario!"

04:33.587 --> 04:36.822
So, I take it things
didn't go great with Larry?

04:36.824 --> 04:38.841
Well, he does know
that Lyndsey's cheating on him,

04:38.843 --> 04:40.960
but the good news is he doesn't
know that it's with me.

04:40.962 --> 04:42.812
So, why do you look

04:42.814 --> 04:45.715
like one of the Village People
in street clothes?

04:45.717 --> 04:47.800
Ah, well, uh, he hired
a, uh, a private detective,

04:47.802 --> 04:50.102
uh, to watch
the house because, uh,

04:50.104 --> 04:51.854
and here's where it gets
really funny,

04:51.856 --> 04:53.256
um, uh,

04:53.258 --> 04:56.659
he thinks that Lyndsey is
cheating on him with...

04:56.661 --> 04:58.144
No.

04:59.145 --> 05:01.530
No, no, no.

05:01.532 --> 05:03.783
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

05:03.785 --> 05:05.918
It's crazy, right?

05:06.870 --> 05:08.921
Why didn't you
tell him the truth?

05:08.923 --> 05:11.874
Fear, cowardice.

05:11.876 --> 05:13.292
Lack of a dental plan.

05:13.294 --> 05:16.545
Uh, besides, he-he
just lost Lyndsey,

05:16.547 --> 05:17.930
I didn't want him to
lose his best friend.

05:17.932 --> 05:19.498
Okay, well, you're gonna lose
your best friend

05:19.500 --> 05:20.766
if you don't fix this!

05:20.768 --> 05:22.718
Oh, I'm your best friend?

05:22.720 --> 05:24.053
Alan, I am serious.

05:24.055 --> 05:26.389
I do not want a private
detective watching this house.

05:26.391 --> 05:28.357
And I...
and I definitely don't want

05:28.359 --> 05:30.443
an angry boyfriend after me.

05:30.445 --> 05:31.444
Well, you should've
thought of that

05:31.446 --> 05:34.030
before you slept with Lyndsey.

05:34.032 --> 05:36.198
I've got some work to do.

05:36.200 --> 05:37.984
And I'm gonna go out
and run some errands.

05:37.986 --> 05:40.519
And when I get back,
this better be cleaned up.

05:40.521 --> 05:41.904
Oh, oh, don't worry, I'm on it.

05:41.906 --> 05:43.773
Oh, oh, but just in case.

05:47.878 --> 05:49.295
Oh, God!

05:49.297 --> 05:51.714
Is there any look
you can't pull off?

05:52.699 --> 05:54.467
(Italian accent):
I'm-a gonna kill you.

05:58.538 --> 05:59.805
Hey!

05:59.807 --> 06:00.723
Hi-ya!

06:00.725 --> 06:02.091
Oh!

06:03.126 --> 06:04.560
What the hell?

06:04.562 --> 06:06.862
Alan, what are you doing?

06:06.864 --> 06:10.483
At the moment,
looking for my left ball.

06:10.485 --> 06:12.318
Larry just dropped me off.

06:12.320 --> 06:13.819
He could've seen you.

06:13.821 --> 06:15.037
That's why I'm here.
Larry thinks you're

06:15.039 --> 06:16.655
having an affair with Walden.

06:16.657 --> 06:18.491
What? Why would he think that?

06:18.493 --> 06:19.608
Well, because he he hired a P.I.

06:19.610 --> 06:21.610
who t a picture of the two
of you together.

06:21.612 --> 06:24.830
And by the way, it looked
like it was a cold day.

06:24.832 --> 06:26.449
You're an idiot.

06:26.451 --> 06:27.416
I know.

06:27.418 --> 06:28.751
So, what-what are we gonna do?

06:28.753 --> 06:31.987
Okay, look, I've done this
plenty of times before.

06:31.989 --> 06:34.490
The first thing you do
is deny everything.

06:34.492 --> 06:35.591
Right, denial. Wait.

06:35.593 --> 06:36.959
You've done this
plenty of times before?

06:37.627 --> 06:38.627
Did you ever cheat on me?

06:38.629 --> 06:40.629
Never.

06:40.631 --> 06:42.247
Okay, good.

06:42.249 --> 06:43.516
(phone chirps)
Oh!

06:43.518 --> 06:45.267
Oh, it's Larry.

06:45.269 --> 06:46.102
What does he want?

06:46.104 --> 06:47.186
Uh, well, let's see.

06:47.188 --> 06:48.971
Uh, "Just dropped off
the cheating whor...

06:48.973 --> 06:50.389
Lyndsey."

06:51.641 --> 06:52.475
"Want to grab a drink?"

06:52.477 --> 06:53.526
Okay, you go play

06:53.528 --> 06:55.227
the sympathetic friend,
calm him down.

06:55.229 --> 06:56.445
I'll figure sothing out.

06:56.447 --> 06:57.863
Sounds good, uh...

06:57.865 --> 06:59.431
"No problem, bro."

06:59.433 --> 07:00.566
Uh...

07:00.568 --> 07:03.102
Cocktail glass emoji.

07:03.104 --> 07:05.571
Stall him as long as you can.

07:05.573 --> 07:06.539
Right.

07:06.541 --> 07:07.573
I'm sorry I kicked you

07:07.575 --> 07:09.241
in the balls--
is there anything I can do?

07:09.243 --> 07:11.944
You could kiss it
and make it better.

07:11.946 --> 07:13.145
Good-bye, Alan.

07:13.147 --> 07:14.830
Oh, come on!

07:14.832 --> 07:17.083
It's not like I
could do it myself.

07:18.635 --> 07:22.505
God knows I've tried.

07:22.507 --> 07:25.424
(tires screeching)

07:25.426 --> 07:27.593
Get in the car!
Rose?

07:27.595 --> 07:28.677
What are you doing?

07:28.679 --> 07:30.129
Someone's following you.

07:30.131 --> 07:32.214
Yeah, you!

07:32.216 --> 07:35.300
There's no time for this,
you're in danger.

07:35.302 --> 07:37.336
Yeah, from you!

07:37.338 --> 07:38.771
Just get in.

07:38.773 --> 07:39.989
Why would I get in your car?

07:39.991 --> 07:41.023
I mean, the last time

07:41.025 --> 07:42.741
I tried to trust you...

07:42.743 --> 07:44.193
What? What are you looking at?

07:44.195 --> 07:46.979
You got a little spot
on your shirt.

07:46.981 --> 07:48.447
Oh.

07:48.449 --> 07:49.448
(screams)

07:49.450 --> 07:51.700
Drive! Drive! Drive!

07:51.702 --> 07:54.670
Drive! Drive!

07:54.672 --> 07:56.505
I found out more
about this guy.

07:56.507 --> 07:58.824
His name is
Walden Schmidt.

07:58.826 --> 08:00.659
More like lying sack of Schmidt.

08:00.661 --> 08:03.179
(chuckles)
Am I right?

08:03.181 --> 08:06.298
Turns out he's some kind
of stupid Internet billionaire.

08:06.300 --> 08:07.466
Don't you hate
when guys don't work

08:07.468 --> 08:08.601
for a living like you and me?

08:08.603 --> 08:11.353
Amen, Jeff Strongman.

08:11.355 --> 08:12.838
Hey, come on, you know,

08:12.840 --> 08:14.056
this isn't the worst thing
in the world.

08:14.058 --> 08:15.340
You're gonna bounce back.

08:15.342 --> 08:17.276
I guess, I mean,
I should've seen it coming.

08:17.278 --> 08:19.812
I mean, she cheated
on her last boyfriend with me.

08:19.814 --> 08:22.398
Her-her last boyfriend?

08:22.400 --> 08:24.516
Yeah, I guess the guy
was a real loser.

08:24.518 --> 08:26.952
A pathetic freeloader.

08:26.954 --> 08:29.655
Well, that's just conjecture.

08:29.657 --> 08:32.074
I mean, you know, maybe
he's a-a really great guy

08:32.076 --> 08:35.494
and she's just
a crazy lying bitch.

08:35.496 --> 08:36.579
I'm not gonna take it lying down

08:36.581 --> 08:38.330
like the pansy
she was dating before me.

08:38.332 --> 08:41.867
Is "pansy" your word or hers?

08:41.869 --> 08:42.685
Hers.

08:42.687 --> 08:43.669
I'm going to the head.

08:43.671 --> 08:44.753
You get the check

08:44.755 --> 08:46.472
and we'll go pay
this bastard a visit.

08:46.474 --> 08:48.007
Take your time.

08:48.009 --> 08:49.208
No rush.

08:52.395 --> 08:55.214
Oh, come on, Lyndsey,
pick up, pick up, pick up!

08:55.216 --> 08:58.234
(groans)
Of course, voice mail.

08:58.236 --> 09:00.486
Lyndsey, things have gone
from bad to worse.

09:00.488 --> 09:02.688
Larry is gonna confront Walden,
and I don't know what to do.

09:02.690 --> 09:03.856
Call me back.

09:03.858 --> 09:05.057
Oh, and PS-- you and I have

09:05.059 --> 09:07.326
a little issue
to discuss ourselves.

09:07.328 --> 09:10.229
Oh, and PPS--
the "P" stands for "pansy."

09:10.231 --> 09:12.064
Mm-hmm.

09:12.066 --> 09:13.832
Whew.

09:13.834 --> 09:15.334
Looks like we lost him.

09:15.336 --> 09:17.836
What the hell is going on?

09:17.838 --> 09:21.073
Well, I'm pretty sure
Larry hired a hit man.

09:21.075 --> 09:22.625
How do you know about Larry?

09:22.627 --> 09:24.210
Because he's stalking you.

09:24.212 --> 09:25.878
How do you know that?

09:25.880 --> 09:28.180
Because I'm stalking you.

09:28.182 --> 09:29.882
Okay, okay, you know,
this is ridiculous.

09:29.884 --> 09:31.100
I'm calling the police.

09:31.102 --> 09:33.052
And tell them what?

09:33.054 --> 09:35.187
We have no proof
of anything.

09:35.189 --> 09:36.722
And besides, how helpful
were the police

09:36.724 --> 09:37.973
when you called them on me?

09:37.975 --> 09:40.592
Uh, I got them to issue
a restraining order.

09:40.594 --> 09:42.728
Hi.

09:44.264 --> 09:45.597
Okay, I...

09:45.599 --> 09:47.233
Uh-oh, he's back.

09:47.235 --> 09:50.486
I don't know how he
keeps finding us.

09:50.488 --> 09:52.154
I'll tell you how.

09:52.156 --> 09:54.073
The GPS on my cell phone.

09:54.075 --> 09:55.491
Give me that.

09:57.327 --> 10:01.130
I was gonna turn it off,
but okay.

10:01.132 --> 10:02.281
Hang on.

10:02.283 --> 10:03.465
What? Why?

10:03.467 --> 10:06.585
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
(squealing)

10:06.587 --> 10:08.504
Whoa!

10:08.506 --> 10:09.722
(sighs)

10:09.724 --> 10:10.673
That ought to do it.

10:10.675 --> 10:13.759
Okay, you know...
this is nonsense!

10:13.761 --> 10:15.177
(stammers)
Take me home.

10:15.179 --> 10:17.646
Okay, homeward bound.

10:17.648 --> 10:18.847
And gagged.

10:18.849 --> 10:20.232
And tortured for days.

10:20.234 --> 10:23.468
Okay, well, fine,
then take me to a hotel.

10:23.470 --> 10:25.020
Beverly Hills Hotel okay?

10:25.022 --> 10:25.988
It's perfect.

10:25.990 --> 10:27.523
And bang, you're dead.

10:27.525 --> 10:29.608
You need to get
off the grid.

10:29.610 --> 10:31.160
Someplace they
don't expect you.

10:31.162 --> 10:33.478
A place they can't track
your credit cards.

10:33.480 --> 10:36.115
Nobody is acking
my credit cards.

10:36.117 --> 10:39.451
Oh, that wasn't you last night
getting a coffee colonic?

10:40.287 --> 10:44.123
I will not apologize
for a healthy colon.

10:48.878 --> 10:50.929
Okay, here we go.

10:50.931 --> 10:52.698
This place looks perfect.

10:52.700 --> 10:54.717
This place is a dump.

10:54.719 --> 10:57.803
Exactly, and it's the last place
anyone would look for you.

10:57.805 --> 10:59.338
Yeah, but it's the first place

10:59.340 --> 11:01.557
that hepatitis
would look for me.

11:01.559 --> 11:03.675
Okay, this is only temporary.

11:03.677 --> 11:06.028
You lay low,
and I will straighten this out.

11:06.030 --> 11:08.197
Why in God's name
would I trust you?

11:08.199 --> 11:10.015
Look, Walden, I know
that I've caused you

11:10.017 --> 11:11.984
some tiny problems
in the past, but...

11:11.986 --> 11:13.235
Wha...? Tiny?

11:13.237 --> 11:14.536
You pretended to be pregnant

11:14.538 --> 11:16.038
to scare my girlfriend away.

11:16.040 --> 11:19.992
You sicced rabid ferrets on me!

11:19.994 --> 11:23.195
You tied me to my bed
and tried to violate me

11:23.197 --> 11:25.331
with a leaf blower!

11:26.333 --> 11:29.885
It's so sweet you
remember everything.

11:29.887 --> 11:32.137
But I can make up
for all of that now.

11:32.139 --> 11:35.674
Look, when your sink is clogged,
you call a plumber.

11:35.676 --> 11:38.177
When your car breaks down,
you call a mechanic.

11:38.179 --> 11:40.346
When you have a dangerous
psychopath after you,

11:40.348 --> 11:42.398
you call me.

11:42.400 --> 11:43.766
All right, fine.

11:43.768 --> 11:45.351
I am gonna kill Alan.

11:45.353 --> 11:48.387
Oh, if you survive tonight,
you should hire Larry's guy.

11:48.389 --> 11:49.554
He's good.

11:49.556 --> 11:52.358
♪ &lt;i>Men.&lt;/i> ♪

11:58.981 --> 12:01.382
♪ &lt;i>Men.&lt;/i> ♪

12:01.384 --> 12:03.568
Here you go.

12:06.339 --> 12:09.107
This is, uh, this is
the best room you got?

12:09.109 --> 12:11.076
It's the presidential suite.

12:11.078 --> 12:13.612
The president of what?

12:13.614 --> 12:15.580
Crap-o-slovakia?

12:15.582 --> 12:17.499
I could offer you
the honeymoon suite.

12:17.501 --> 12:20.785
You know, if you don't mind
the smell of love.

12:22.071 --> 12:24.256
No, no... this is, uh...

12:24.258 --> 12:25.507
this is fine.

12:25.509 --> 12:27.175
Uh...

12:27.177 --> 12:29.761
Do you, uh, do you
have room service?

12:32.348 --> 12:34.549
I might have something
you might want to eat.

12:36.435 --> 12:38.603
I don't think you do.

12:41.257 --> 12:45.143
Listen, uh, if-if anyone
comes here asking about me,

12:45.145 --> 12:46.645
I-I'm not here.

12:46.647 --> 12:47.896
Don't worry.

12:47.898 --> 12:50.098
No one will ever find you.

12:56.405 --> 12:59.324
Hey, uh, if you get
lonely later on,

12:59.326 --> 13:01.293
I'm in the apartment
behind the building.

13:01.295 --> 13:03.545
Yeah, okay.

13:03.547 --> 13:05.947
It's nothing fancy,
but I've got some good weed

13:05.949 --> 13:09.417
and... a spa tub.

13:09.419 --> 13:12.637
I'll, uh, keep that in mind.

13:12.639 --> 13:14.556
There's a live feed
on channel 14

13:14.558 --> 13:16.224
if you want to check it out.

13:21.130 --> 13:22.397
(door closes)

13:22.399 --> 13:25.517
Great, now I got
to hide from him, too.

13:28.771 --> 13:32.190
This Walden guy is gonna regret
the day he stole my girlfriend.

13:32.192 --> 13:34.475
Oh, it's-it's not stealing.
It-It's more like borrowing.

13:34.477 --> 13:36.311
Like-like renting a car.

13:36.313 --> 13:37.946
Yeah, but when you rent a car
you know there's been

13:37.948 --> 13:40.481
other guys inside it,
turning the knobs,

13:40.483 --> 13:41.750
playing with the seat,

13:41.752 --> 13:43.451
shoving stuff in the trunk.

13:43.453 --> 13:45.670
Okay, okay, maybe that's
a bad analogy.

13:45.672 --> 13:47.339
But that doesn't change
the fact that going over there

13:47.341 --> 13:49.541
to confront him is not
gonna help anything.

13:49.543 --> 13:50.842
You got a better idea?

13:50.844 --> 13:51.843
Uh, I-I do.

13:51.845 --> 13:53.545
How about you forget
about Lyndsey

13:53.547 --> 13:55.847
and we go out to a bar
and pick up some women.

13:55.849 --> 13:57.999
You know, Larry and Jeff
out on the prowl.

13:58.001 --> 13:59.667
(growls)

13:59.669 --> 14:01.720
Jeff, I appreciate
what you're trying to do.

14:01.722 --> 14:03.171
But I'm afraid
if I don't do this,

14:03.173 --> 14:05.690
I won't be able
to live with myself.

14:06.776 --> 14:08.360
And I'm afraid if you do this,

14:08.362 --> 14:11.062
I'll have to live by myself.

14:12.398 --> 14:14.599
(indistinct chatter on TV)

14:16.836 --> 14:19.537
Oh, no! Channel 14!

14:27.747 --> 14:29.714
Oh, God!

14:29.716 --> 14:31.249
(knocking)

14:32.034 --> 14:34.085
Who is it?

14:34.087 --> 14:36.755
(deep voice): It's Larry, I'm here
to kill you, Walden.

14:36.757 --> 14:39.140
Mr. Walden, he die.

14:39.142 --> 14:41.559
I clean room.

14:41.561 --> 14:43.378
ROSE:
No, silly rabbit, it's just me.

14:43.380 --> 14:45.146
Wha...? Rose?

14:45.148 --> 14:47.548
Is that...?

14:47.550 --> 14:49.100
Are you alone?

14:49.102 --> 14:53.121
Yeah, but a nice man did just
invite me into his spa tub.

14:54.440 --> 14:57.409
Here, I brought some food.

14:57.411 --> 14:58.660
Yeah, I can't eat.

14:58.662 --> 14:59.727
Why not?

14:59.729 --> 15:01.079
Well, because if I do,

15:01.081 --> 15:02.914
eventually
I'll have to go in there.

15:04.367 --> 15:06.618
And I'm not going in there.

15:06.620 --> 15:08.753
Uh, so, did you find
anything out?

15:08.755 --> 15:11.172
Still no sign of Larry.
He could be anywhere.

15:11.174 --> 15:13.208
God, Alan was supposed
to take care of this.

15:13.210 --> 15:15.010
Well, yeah, he also told you
he was only gonna live

15:15.012 --> 15:18.913
at your house a few days, and
here we are at day 800 and...

15:18.915 --> 15:20.748
43.

15:20.750 --> 15:22.684
Oh, I almost forgot.

15:22.686 --> 15:24.552
I t usgoome candy bars.

15:24.554 --> 15:26.771
Mounds for you,
'cause it's your favorite.

15:26.773 --> 15:27.806
Aw.

15:27.808 --> 15:28.857
Almond Joy for me

15:28.859 --> 15:31.359
'cause, you know... nuts.

15:33.279 --> 15:35.980
Hey, why are you being
so nice to me?

15:35.982 --> 15:39.150
You know,
I'll admit that you hurt me.

15:39.152 --> 15:42.603
And I did some things
that I'm not proud of.

15:43.656 --> 15:45.290
But just because
you took a restraining order

15:45.292 --> 15:47.242
out against me...

15:47.244 --> 15:51.162
doesn't mean that I can
restrain my feelings for you.

15:51.164 --> 15:53.214
That is the sweetest,

15:53.216 --> 15:55.717
most terrifying thing

15:55.719 --> 15:57.635
I've ever heard.

15:59.388 --> 16:01.723
Are you really
scared of me?

16:01.725 --> 16:05.293
You're not even the scariest
person I've met in this room.

16:07.680 --> 16:10.398
And the truth is,
I'm-I'm not blameless.

16:10.400 --> 16:12.100
I mean, I chose
another girl over you,

16:12.102 --> 16:16.071
and look who's here
with me now?

16:16.638 --> 16:19.491
I never really left you.

16:21.110 --> 16:23.278
Literally.

16:26.198 --> 16:29.200
File this under things
I'm gonna regret.

16:33.456 --> 16:36.657
Damn it, should've
brought my leaf blower.

16:43.832 --> 16:45.600
Oh, uh,
the doorbell doesn't work.

16:45.602 --> 16:47.469
What?

16:47.471 --> 16:49.504
I mean, uh,
that-that does not work

16:49.506 --> 16:52.673
if you want to send a message
that there's a man here.

16:53.642 --> 16:54.976
♪ Ding-dong.

16:54.978 --> 16:56.478
"I'm gonna kick your tushie."

16:56.480 --> 16:58.863
You're right.
Yeah.

16:58.865 --> 17:00.315
Oh.

17:00.317 --> 17:02.350
Okay, now, listen,
now-now, this could get crazy.

17:02.352 --> 17:04.202
I mean, there's gonna be
a lot of name calling--

17:04.204 --> 17:06.354
uh, uh, jerk, uh, idiot,
uh, Alan.

17:06.356 --> 17:07.789
Uh...

17:08.774 --> 17:10.575
Larry?
Lyndsey?

17:10.577 --> 17:13.995
I know exactly what's going on
between you and Walden Schmidt.

17:13.997 --> 17:15.747
Now, where is he?

17:15.749 --> 17:18.500
Wow! This house
is amazing.

17:21.587 --> 17:23.888
Larry, this isn't
what you think.

17:23.890 --> 17:25.373
It's exactly what I think.

17:25.375 --> 17:26.591
I have pictures.

17:26.593 --> 17:28.209
We're standing in his house!

17:28.211 --> 17:30.512
Okay, it-it's time for me
to tell you the truth.

17:30.514 --> 17:33.264
Don't believe her!
She's a cheating, drunk whore!

17:35.901 --> 17:37.318
Larry, listen to me.

17:37.320 --> 17:39.354
I'm not here to sleep
with Walden Schmidt.

17:39.356 --> 17:41.055
I'm here to sleep
with someone else.

17:41.057 --> 17:42.607
What?!
What?!

17:43.492 --> 17:44.609
Remember you told me

17:44.611 --> 17:46.828
your fantasy was
to see me with another woman?

17:46.830 --> 17:49.063
Yeah?
Yeah?

17:50.065 --> 17:52.000
I've arranged for your dream
to come true.

17:52.002 --> 17:53.334
You did?!
You did?!

17:53.336 --> 17:56.087
Yes, that's why I rented
this beautiful beach house

17:56.089 --> 17:58.739
from Walden Schmidt
as a birthday surprise.

17:58.741 --> 18:01.242
I also got us something else.

18:01.244 --> 18:04.295
So, which one is watching us?

18:04.297 --> 18:07.098
If it's him, I'm gonna
have to charge extra.

18:09.385 --> 18:11.052
Wait a minute.
Is this for real?

18:11.054 --> 18:13.087
Happy birthday, baby.

18:13.089 --> 18:15.056
Wow. Wow.

18:15.058 --> 18:16.641
(laughs)
A threesome.

18:16.643 --> 18:18.193
That is quite
a gift.

18:18.195 --> 18:20.195
Well, it was last minute,

18:20.197 --> 18:22.564
and I had to think of something.

18:22.566 --> 18:25.984
A nice cardigan wouldn't
have done the trick?

18:25.986 --> 18:27.235
God, I feel so stupid.

18:27.237 --> 18:28.953
I even hired someone
to follow you.

18:28.955 --> 18:30.705
Well, why don't you
call them off,

18:30.707 --> 18:32.073
and we'll all go sit down

18:32.075 --> 18:34.459
and talk about the things
you want to see?

18:34.461 --> 18:36.878
Bye, Jeff.

18:36.880 --> 18:37.996
Yeah, bye, Jeff.

18:37.998 --> 18:40.215
I'll send you a
copy of the video.

18:41.383 --> 18:42.567
Wait. Thi-Thi...
Wait. This is

18:42.569 --> 18:43.718
really... happening?

18:43.720 --> 18:45.587
I mean, you-you-you
and-and-and her?

18:45.589 --> 18:47.639
And-and... and him?

18:47.641 --> 18:49.757
And-and-and here?

18:49.759 --> 18:51.959
While... while I...?

18:51.961 --> 18:54.295
Son of a bitch!

18:54.297 --> 18:55.647
(mutters)

18:55.649 --> 18:56.864
This is crazy.

18:56.866 --> 18:58.066
You know, I'll...
I'll bet

18:58.068 --> 19:00.018
if Lyndsey had been sleeping
with somebody else,

19:00.020 --> 19:03.404
he'd be really, really mad.

19:03.406 --> 19:05.156
I know.
Isn't this great, Jeff?

19:05.158 --> 19:07.775
She's not a cheating whore.
She's just a whore.

19:08.944 --> 19:10.645
Hi. It's Larry Martin.

19:10.647 --> 19:13.481
Oh, hey.

19:13.483 --> 19:15.750
Listen, I'm not going to be
needing your services anymore,

19:15.752 --> 19:17.085
but I appreciate all your help.

19:17.087 --> 19:18.620
No problem.

19:18.622 --> 19:19.837
It was my pleasure.

19:19.839 --> 19:21.956
Good-bye.

19:23.092 --> 19:25.326
That was Alan.

19:25.328 --> 19:26.461
What did he say?

19:26.463 --> 19:30.765
Well, he, uh, thanked me
for protecting you.

19:30.767 --> 19:32.467
But there's still no sign
of Larry.

19:32.469 --> 19:34.802
And as long as he's out there,
you're not safe.

19:34.804 --> 19:36.671
I'm gonna go get us
some supplies.

19:36.673 --> 19:38.056
No, don't go!

19:38.058 --> 19:39.557
We're having a good time.

19:39.559 --> 19:42.009
You're just a sticky
little honey bun, aren't you?

19:42.011 --> 19:44.345
Now, don't try
to get in touch with anyone,

19:44.347 --> 19:46.197
or Larry will kill you.

19:47.066 --> 19:49.284
Kisses.

19:49.286 --> 19:51.452
(sighs)

19:53.572 --> 19:55.990
I got to go to the bathroom.

19:58.794 --> 20:01.028
Screw it.
I'll just pee the bed.

20:04.917 --> 20:06.918
(thunder rumbling)

20:06.920 --> 20:08.886
(heavy footsteps)

20:11.390 --> 20:13.157
Rose?

20:13.159 --> 20:15.460
(loud jangling of keys)

20:15.462 --> 20:16.894
All right, come on, Rose.

20:16.896 --> 20:19.147
This... this...
It's not funny.

20:19.149 --> 20:21.516
(thunder crackling)

20:23.402 --> 20:25.570
Larry?!

20:26.655 --> 20:29.490
Listen, we can... we can...
we can work this out!

20:29.492 --> 20:31.609
It's-it's just
a little misunderstanding.

20:31.611 --> 20:32.994
(door rattling)

20:32.996 --> 20:34.612
Oh, God! I...

20:34.614 --> 20:36.831
(door rattling loudly)

20:42.904 --> 20:44.839
Well, that was rude.

20:44.841 --> 20:46.958
Looks like I took a shower
for nothing.

20:46.960 --> 20:49.711
♪ &lt;i>Men.&lt;/i> ♪

21:00.045 --> 21:03.981
♪ Come out, come out,
wherever you are! ♪

21:08.020 --> 21:09.904
I hate you, Jeff Strongman.

21:09.906 --> 21:14.906
